    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brendan Cryan of REMAX Partners is delighted to bring to the market this beautiful and spacious 5-bedroom, 3 bathroom detached property located in Abbeyfarm Celbridge.\r\nOccupying one of the most desirable positions within this highly regarded development the property enjoys \r\nwonderful views of a large green area which slopes down towards the banks of the River Liffey.\r\nThe property consists of an entrance hall, cloakroom, guest w.c. large sitting/dining room, \r\nkitchen and utility room completes downstairs.\r\nUpstairs there are five bedrooms (four doubles, one single) with the principal bedroom en-suite, and a family \r\nbathroom. Outside there is a garden to the front with parking for a number of cars and the generous 50 ft rear garden is thoughtfully laid out with grass, plants and a block garage with electricity and an electric shutter door.\r\n\r\n Some Special Features\r\n5 Bedroom 3 Bathrooms\r\n1852 sq. ft / 172 sq. mtrs\r\nBER B3\r\nExcellent garden orientation.\r\nRecently fitted solar panels \r\nE.V. Charger\r\nBack-up power Generator.\r\nLocation, Location ,Location,\r\n\r\nCharacterised by mature tree lined avenues and extensive green open spaces Abbey Farm enjoys an idyllic setting on the banks of the River Liffey and is widely regarded as one of Celbridge's most desirable \r\nresidential developments. \r\nAbbey Farm is only a short stroll to Main Street Celbridge where there are a wide range of schools shops, and local amenities. Celbridge has excellent public transport with frequent bus service to Dublin City and rail links \r\nfrom Hazel Hatch"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALLWAY: c.5.98 x2.39m\r\nCoving, centre rose, light fittings, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE: c.8.76 x 3.67m\r\nCoving, centre rose, light fittings, feature fireplace with stove, curtains, blinds, \r\nTV/cable point, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nSTUDY: c.4.75 x 3.00m\r\nCoving, light fittings, curtains, blinds, feature fireplace with stove, TV/cable point, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN: c.4.77 x 4.53m\r\nLight fittings, 2 x Velux windows, fitted units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, blind, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUTILITY ROOM: c.1.98 x 2.58.\r\nLight fitting, fitted units, stainless steel sink, tiled splash back, area plumbed, tiled floor, door leading to back garden.\r\n\r\nWC:c.1.28 x 2.00m\r\nLight fitting, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLANDING: cx.2.88 x 4.57m\r\nLight fitting, hot press, attic access, carpet.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c.4.32 x 3.39m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.0.97 x 2.32m\r\nLight fitting, tiled floor, WC, WHB, tiled cubicle with power shower.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: c.3.68 x 3.17m\r\nLight fitting, blind, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: c.4.25 x 2.43m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 4: c.3.45 x 2.74m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 5: c.3.12 x 2.36m\r\nLight fitting, blind, curtains, wooden floor, TV/cable point.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM: c.2.54 x 2.36m\r\nLight fitting, floor & wall tiling, WC, WHB, bath, tiled cubicle with electric Triton \r\nT90 shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "INTERNAL FEATURES\r\nAll curtains and carpets included in sale\r\nAll blinds included in sale\r\nAll light fittings included in sale\r\nProperty fully alarmed\r\nSome appliances included in sale\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL FEATURES\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nPVC facia and soffits\r\nOutside tap\r\nOutside light\r\nSecurity lights\r\nPatio area\r\nLandscaped gardens\r\nRaised flower beds\r\nSide gates\r\nLocated in quiet cul de sac\r\nProperty not overlooked to front/rear\r\nCobble lock driveway\r\nBarna shed\r\nBlock shed with electricity\r\nOnsite parking\r\n\r\nSERVICES/HEATING:\t\r\nMains water \r\nMains sewerage\r\nO.F.C.H.\r\nSolar Panels\r\nEV Charging point\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA: c.172.05 sq. mtrs.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY AGE: 1991\r\n\r\nBER RATING: B3\r\n\r\nBER NUMBER: 117050005\r\n\r\nGARDEN ORIENTATION: \r\nNorth West\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER: All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permission for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any intending purchaser or tenant should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy himself/herself by inspection or    otherwise as to the correctness of each of them."
